              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">How much does it cost to install a mini split?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                A professionally installed single-zone system typically runs $3,000 to $6,500 depending on brand and site difficulty, of which $1,200 to $3,000 is labor. A DIY system like the MRCOOL costs $1,200 to $2,200 including an electrician for the circuit. Multi-zone whole-house conversions with three to five heads generally land between $9,000 and $20,000 installed.
              </p>
