                Roughly 9,000 BTU for 150-350 square feet, 12,000 BTU for 350-550, 18,000 BTU for 550-800, and 24,000 BTU for 800-1,200. Size up for uninsulated garages, vaulted ceilings, or large west-facing glass; size down for well-insulated, shaded spaces. When a room falls between sizes, choose the smaller one — oversized units short-cycle and leave rooms cold and humid.
              </p>
