            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">How long do mini splits last?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Premium Japanese-brand systems commonly reach 15 to 20 years with annual maintenance, and carry 10 to 12-year compressor warranties that reflect that. Value brands more typically last 10 to 15 years. Installation quality matters as much as brand: a poor vacuum on the line set at commissioning leaves moisture in the system and is the most common cause of early compressor failure.
